          "date": "2026-11-14 18:05:28.000000000",
          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "LU-21214 uapi: fix lov_foreign_hsm_to_le() swab source",
        "message": "LU-21214 uapi: fix lov_foreign_hsm_to_le() swab source\n\nlov_foreign_hsm_to_le() swabs dst's own (uninitialized) field back\ninto itself instead of swabbing src into dst, so the caller's\nlhb_archive_id/lhb_archive_ver are silently dropped from the\non-disk lov_foreign_md for HSM-typed foreign layout components.\nlhb_uuid is unaffected since it is a plain memcpy().\n\nSwab from src into dst, matching the inverse helper\nlov_foreign_hsm_to_cpu().\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: aebb405e32e4 (\"LU-10499 pcc: use foreign layout for PCCRO on server side\")\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [claude-code]\nChange-Id: Ie8afec479b6a92f67ad3291778a1a622c7022bed\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
